{"words": [{"text": "فَأَزَلَّهُمَا", "translation": "Then made [both of] them slip"}, {"text": "ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ", "translation": "the Shaitaan"}, {"text": "عَنْهَا", "translation": "from it"}, {"text": "فَأَخْرَجَهُمَا", "translation": "and he got [both of] them out"}, {"text": "مِمَّا", "translation": "from what"}, {"text": "كَانَا", "translation": "they [both] were"}, {"text": "فِيهِ ۖ", "translation": "in [it]"}, {"text": "وَقُلْنَا", "translation": "And We said"}, {"text": "ٱهْبِطُوا۟", "translation": "Go down (all of you)"}, {"text": "بَعْضُكُمْ", "translation": "some of you"}, {"text": "لِبَعْضٍ", "translation": "to others"}, {"text": "عَدُوٌّۭ ۖ", "translation": "(as) enemy"}, {"text": "وَلَكُمْ", "translation": "and for you"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "translation": "the earth"}, {"text": "مُسْتَقَرٌّۭ", "translation": "(is) a dwelling place"}, {"text": "وَمَتَـٰعٌ", "translation": "and a provision"}, {"text": "إِلَىٰ", "translation": "for"}, {"text": "حِينٍۢ", "translation": "a period"}], "sahih": "But Satan caused them to slip out of it and removed them from that [condition] in which they had been. And We said, \"Go down, [all of you], as enemies to one another, and you will have upon the earth a place of settlement and provision for a time.\""}